      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/ameena/{size}/1907_2.png",
      "created_at": "2017-07-20T13:56:59.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Yeah, every other forum I use gives a litle pop-up window letting me know if I get a PM. On this one I have to go into \"My Account\" and then \"Messages\" to see if I've had any PMs. It's not something I can be arsed to do very often so I have occasionally missed PMs. Fortunately I don't get sent them very often right now so I haven't missed anything for a while ;).</p>",
