      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/rabit/{size}/7330_2.png",
      "created_at": "2017-07-20T14:37:13.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Oh, don’t get me wrong – it’s crap. <img src=\"//forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/frowning.png?v=9\" title=\":frowning:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":frowning:\"><br>\nI just wanted to make sure you knew that was there. <img src=\"//forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/wink.png?v=9\" title=\":wink:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":wink:\"></p>\n<p>Ameena, FYI: You don’t have to go to “Messages” – just going to your account will show you if you have any new messages. Like I said, it’s annoying, but it’s there… :-/ You are absolutely correct that notification for messages is usually base forum functionality. <img src=\"//forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/frowning.png?v=9\" title=\":frowning:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":frowning:\"></p>",
